{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/3ce36f1fe6309fca269fa1fcd9ea959e.poster.avif?t=1770631024\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/3ce36f1fe6309fca269fa1fcd9ea959e.webm?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/3ce36f1fe6309fca269fa1fcd9ea959e.mp4?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand of Hexes is a <strong>no-text deckbuilder</strong> and <strong>tower defense</strong> game where you control the enemies' paths by constructing deadly mazes \u2013 using towers with crazy attack patterns. Create a perfect deck of exotic towers and magical spells that boost your defenses or slay your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/da21656220ad84084d748c7c1a8d91b3.poster.avif?t=1770631024\" width=1000 height=2000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/da21656220ad84084d748c7c1a8d91b3.webm?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/da21656220ad84084d748c7c1a8d91b3.mp4?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/03e70934520a2c4928df752290a16026.avif?t=1770631024\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/0d846e098a61951da9ca515ef81b187e.poster.avif?t=1770631024\" width=780 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/0d846e098a61951da9ca515ef81b187e.webm?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/0d846e098a61951da9ca515ef81b187e.mp4?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is <strong>unique</strong> with different decks, encounters, and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no text and no descriptions - </strong>find out what each tower and spell does through trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way across a variety of <strong>procedural maps</strong> - and do it again, but <strong>harder</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/cb47239c2c410c259e7ee5764c656dfb.avif?t=1770631024\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/84338f9561be222895e6aaf3a2aa7fff.poster.avif?t=1770631024\" width=780 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/84338f9561be222895e6aaf3a2aa7fff.webm?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/84338f9561be222895e6aaf3a2aa7fff.mp4?t=1770631024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hand of Hexes towers hav